<title>USA: Essef to take $0.35/shr charge in fiscal Q4.</title>
<headline>Essef to take $0.35/shr charge in fiscal Q4.</headline>
<dateline>CHARDON, Ohio 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Essef Corp said Wednesday it would take a charge of $2.3 million, or $0.35 a share, in the quarter ending September 30 to pay for closing its Pac-Fab plant in City of Industry, California.</p>
<p>The company said the plant's closing should generate about $2.5 million in annual savings. Most of the plant's production will move to its facility in Moorpark, California, and some to Sanford, North Carolina.</p>
